PN,41901
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,7,Foyster reef has been launched in north
OL,8,FAntrim.
OL,10,FThe initiative is the latest stage in
OL,11,Fwork by the charity Ulster Wildlife to
OL,12,Frestore the near-extinct native
OL,13,FEuropean flat oyster and create
OL,14,Fhealthier seas.
OL,16,FThe custom-built floating reef at
OL,17,FGlenarm Marina has been described as
OL,18,Fproviding a sheltered habitat where
OL,19,FEuropean oysters can grow and thrive.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/11
