PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FIt currently supports around 10,000
OL,7,Fjuvenile European oysters, known as
OL,8,Fspat, settled on scallop shells,
OL,9,Falongside approximately 200 adult
OL,10,Foysters growing inside biodegradable
OL,11,Fbags.
OL,13,FWhile native oyster reefs were once a
OL,14,Fcommon feature of Northern Ireland's
OL,15,Fcoastline, they have declined
OL,16,Fdramatically because of
OL,17,Foverharvesting, habitat loss, disease
OL,18,Fand pollution.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
