FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FUlster Wildlife described European
OL,7,Foysters as "natural ecosystem
OL,8,Fengineers", playing a vital role in
OL,9,Fimproving water quality, increasing
OL,10,Fbiodiversity and creating habitat for
OL,11,Fa wide range of marine species.
OL,13,FThe floating reef builds on the local
OL,14,Fnature conservation charity's existing
OL,15,Fnative oyster nursery at Glenarm
OL,16,FMarina as well as wider work to
OL,17,Frestore native oysters in Northern
OL,18,FIreland.
OL,26,@oD@LOUpD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
