PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FEarlier this year, the charity
OL,7,Fcompleted its first deployment of
OL,8,Fnative oysters onto the seabed in
OL,9,FBelfast Lough, marking an important
OL,10,Fmilestone in the return of this once-
OL,11,Fabundant species.
OL,13,FThe new floating reef at Glenarm
OL,14,FMarina recreates the habitat of a
OL,15,Fnatural oyster reef above the seabed
OL,16,Fand is hoped to provide a new way to
OL,17,Fscale up native European oyster
OL,18,Frestoration in Northern Ireland.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FUlster Wildlife said early results are
OL,7,Fencouraging, with oyster survival
OL,8,Frates exceeding 80%.
OL,10,FAn Eco-Detect camera system has been
OL,11,Finstalled alongside the floating reef
OL,12,Fto record the mobile species visiting
OL,13,Fand interacting with the structure
OL,14,Faround the clock, providing valuable
OL,15,Fnew insights into how oyster reef
OL,16,Fhabitats support marine life.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
