FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FDuring its first three months of
OL,7,Foperation, the system has recorded
OL,8,Fmore than 7,000 wildlife detections,
OL,9,Fincluding fish such as gobies and
OL,10,Fseabirds including black guillemots.
OL,12,FThe findings are helping Ulster
OL,13,FWildlife build a more complete picture
OL,14,Fof the biodiversity value of oyster
OL,15,Freefs, complementing existing research
OL,16,Ffrom its nurseries on less mobile
OL,17,Fspecies such as sea slugs, worms and
OL,18,Fother invertebrates.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
