PN,41907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FDr Nick Baker Horne, marine
OL,7,Fconservation manager at Ulster
OL,8,FWildlife, who has led the initiative,
OL,9,Fdescribed "an exciting new chapter" in
OL,10,Fthe bid to restore the native European
OL,11,Foyster to Northern Ireland's seas.
OL,13,F"It allows us to showcase the
OL,14,Fincredible habitat created by native
OL,15,Foysters while continuing to build our
OL,16,Foyster restoration efforts and deepen
OL,17,Four understanding of the wildlife
OL,18,Fthese reefs can support," he said.
OL,26,@qD@KOUqD@cO]uD@AOUzD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,F"Thanks to Eco-Detect's camera system,
OL,7,Fwe can now see what species are
OL,8,Finteracting with this floating reef,
OL,9,Fday and night.
OL,11,F"Oyster reefs are true ecosystem
OL,12,Fengineers ` they help improve water
OL,13,Fquality, support richer marine
OL,14,Fbiodiversity and create healthier
OL,15,Fcoastal ecosystems.
OL,17,F"Clearer waters and thriving marine
OL,18,Flife can benefit local fisheries,
OL,19,Fwhile living reefs also store carbon
OL,20,Fand help protect coastlines from storm
OL,21,Fsurges.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,420,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,F"Restoring these vital habitats is
OL,7,Fessential if we want to build
OL,8,Fhealthier, more resilient seas for the
OL,9,Ffuture."
OL,11,FThe project also has wider ambitions
OL,12,Ffor marine habitat restoration with
OL,13,FUlster Wildlife planning to develop
OL,14,Fmethods for collecting naturally
OL,15,Fwashed-up seagrass on the floating
OL,16,Freef before growing and replanting it
OL,17,Fto strengthen the local seagrass
OL,18,Fmeadow in Glenarm and boost this vital
OL,19,Fand fragile underwater habitat.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/11
