PN,41910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1786048343
OL,3,CNorthern Ireland's first floating
OL,4,Coyster reef launched in north Antrim
OL,6,FThe floating oyster reef has been
OL,7,Fdeveloped by Ulster Wildlife in
OL,8,Fpartnership with Mid and East Antrim
OL,9,FBorough Council and is funded by the
OL,10,FDepartment of Agriculture, Environment
OL,11,Fand Rural Affairs (Daera) via the
OL,12,Fcarrier bag levy.
OL,14,FThe project forms part of a wider
OL,15,Fprogramme to restore native oysters
OL,16,Fand other blue carbon habitats around
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,19,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,20,FITVX
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/11
